              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0560",
              "oldText": "Except to the extent any jointly-owned inventions or intellectual property are included in subject matter licensed by one Party to the other Party under this Agreement, each Party may only practice any such jointly-owned inventions or intellectual property for its own internal purposes, and neither Party shall have the right to enforce, license, or assign such jointly- owned inventions or intellectual property, without the prior written consent of the other Party.",
              "newText": "Subject only to the exclusive licenses expressly granted under this Agreement, each Party shall have the unrestricted right to practice, use and otherwise exploit, and to grant licenses and sublicenses under, any such jointly-owned inventions and intellectual property for any purpose, without the consent of, and without any obligation to account to, the other Party; provided that neither Party shall assign its interest in such jointly-owned inventions or intellectual property, other than to an Affiliate or in connection with a permitted assignment of this Agreement, without the prior written consent of the other Party."
